eue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">千问正式上线全周期高考志愿填报Agent，提供免费个性化咨询服务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anysphere发布Cursor自研大模型，同步推出Origin Git平台及iOS移动端App</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic推出企业级AI协同工具Claude Tag，实现Slack平台始终在线协作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">火山引擎发布豆包音频生成模型1.0，支持长时音色一致性与多模态生成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/572c2dbf52cde57f667987ba7752016e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月23日，火山引擎正式发布豆包音频生成模型1.0，通过“多模态参考生成”与“长时音色一致性”技术，实现从文本Prompt直接生成具备叙事张力的完整音频成片。该模型解决了传统音频制作中对白、音效与配乐需手动混音的繁琐流程，并针对长音频创作中的“角色串戏”痛点，确保多次延长生成时音色高度稳定。其核心优势在于“0样本多模态音频创造”能力，支持文本或参考音频输入，无需额外训练即可实现音色与风格的深度解耦，支持“一声多角”演绎。目前，火山方舟已开启该模型的API邀测，个人用户可获30分钟创作额度。该技术后续将接入剪映、即梦及番茄等平台，旨在将音频创作从繁琐的剪辑拼接升级为高效的“创意导演”模式，显著降低专业音频制作门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动豆包上线三档付费订阅服务，接入豆包2.1系列大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e37e983a1c8301b5555831ce3f9b61de.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月24日，字节跳动旗下AI助手豆包正式上线三档付费订阅服务，标志着其商业化进程的开启。此次推出的付费版分为标准版（68元/月）、加强版（200元/月）及高级版（500元/月），整体接入了全新升级的豆包2.1系列大模型。官方表示，免费用户日常使用不受影响。在定价策略上，豆包通过显著的本土价格优势，将高阶AI能力的使用门槛进一步拉低，其高级版包年费用为5088元，远低于海外同类竞品。此次付费订阅的落地，标志着国内大模型应用从单纯的“参数竞争”阶段，加速转向“高价值服务变现”的新周期，或将引发国内大模型应用层新一轮的商业化定价博弈。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">千问正式上线全周期高考志愿填报Agent，提供免费个性化咨询服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40f50b1a6529afd4e04f101211f9b577.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月10日，千问正式推出国内首个全周期高考志愿填报Agent，标志着大厂正式入局志愿填报市场并实行免费策略。该Agent将填报流程拆解为七个核心环节，通过大模型技术提供志愿日历、个性化志愿报告及针对性问答服务，实现了人类专家对话能力的规模化与低成本化。此举对依赖志愿卡售卖及低价咨询引流的传统中小机构构成直接冲击，行业商业模式面临重构压力。对于考生而言，该工具提供了更高性价比的填报辅助。千问此次动作是其“AI+教育”战略的关键一环，未来服务将延伸至更长周期的人生规划场景，旨在构建全维度的智能化咨询生态。随着免费AI填报工具的普及，传统志愿填报行业已进入洗牌倒计时，机构需在智能化时代重新寻找不可替代的专业价值。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anysphere发布Cursor自研大模型，同步推出Origin Git平台及iOS移动端App</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/36291cef14512cad797ff97f8f54ee4b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anysphere在Compile26活动上宣布，旗下IDE工具Cursor将推出首个完全自主训练的基础模型，并同步发布Git平台Origin及iOS测试版App。该自研模型由Anysphere与SpaceX联合训练，参数规模对标Claude Opus与GPT系列，底层计算量较前代提升10至20倍，旨在服务更广泛的非编码领域，预计未来几周内面世。全新Git平台Origin采用云原生架构，支持数千个AI Agent同时读写代码库，具备自动解决合并冲突、修复CI测试及处理代码注释能力，计划2026年秋季上线。此外，Cursor Mobile iOS测试版允许用户远程管理AI Agent并处理任务。此次更新标志着Cursor从单一IDE向综合性开发者生态平台转型，推动AI Agent规模化协作进入工程化落地阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic推出企业级AI协同工具Claude Tag，实现Slack平台始终在线协作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/08153725c2814b5a913be00561b763e0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布企业级AI工具Claude Tag，该工具深度集成于Slack平台，旨在通过“始终在线”的协同实体模式，将AI转化为企业的全职同事。目前，Claude Tag测试版已面向Claude Enterprise和Claude Team客户开放。与现有集成相比，Claude Tag引入了持久上下文与记忆层，能够长期追踪频道对话脉络，自主学习组织工作流与业务逻辑。通过跨频道读取权限，该工具支持全组织范围的信息检索，并允许团队成员共享同一Claude身份以无缝承接工作进度。在安全管控方面，系统管理员可精细化定义每个Claude身份的工具调用权限、信息获取范围及频道访问权限。此外，Claude Tag具备“主动模式”，可自主加入群聊并针对遗忘议题进行跟进，同时支持将复杂目标解构为多阶段任务，通过调用</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
